{"id":"6e5fa86a227392e1","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-universal.md","title":"枚举定理与通用机器的存在","display":"thm-universal — 枚举定理与通用机器的存在","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-universal","aliases":["20-thm-universal"],"display":"thm-universal — 枚举定理与通用机器的存在","chapter":"1","section":"1.5","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Theorem 1.5.3","source_pdf_pages":[47],"source_printed_pages":[11],"depends_on":["[[20-df-utm]]","[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-universal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-universal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-universal — 枚举定理与通用机器的存在"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"section","html":"1.5"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 1.5.3"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>47</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>11</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"265b037f1125c93c\" href=\"?note=265b037f1125c93c\" title=\"20-df-utm\">20-df-utm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Universal}\">\\(\\operatorname{Universal}\\)</span> 见上游。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"265b037f1125c93c\" href=\"?note=265b037f1125c93c\" title=\"20-df-utm\">20-df-utm</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}universal}\\vdash\n\\exists u\\in\\omega\\ \\operatorname{Universal}(u).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}universal}\\vdash\n\\exists u\\in\\omega\\ \\operatorname{Universal}(u).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>一个固定程序先译码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span>，然后模拟 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_e\">\\(P_e\\)</span> 的配置序列，正常停止时复制其输出。输入程序不存在正常停止输出时模拟也不给出正常停止输出。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda(e,x)\\varphi_e(x)\">\\(\\lambda(e,x)\\varphi_e(x)\\)</span> 部分可计算，其一元配对形式具有固定索引。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 1.5.3；印刷页 11；PDF 第 47 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-utm","status":"resolved","id":"265b037f1125c93c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-utm]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-utm","status":"resolved","id":"265b037f1125c93c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-utm]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-utm]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Universal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}universal}\\vdash\n\\exists u\\in\\omega\\ \\operatorname{Universal}(u).","display":true},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"P_e","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda(e,x)\\varphi_e(x)","display":false}],"bytes":1110,"backlinks":[{"id":"d18ba716e49ac8c6","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-K]]；see [[20-df-recursive]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-thm-universal]]。"}],"outgoing":["265b037f1125c93c","e343870c773cb68e"]}